Example:

```
pingpong_sup:start_link().

pingpongA:create_map([a,b,c,d,e], [1,2,3,4,5]).
pingpongA:create_map([a,b,c,d,e], [1,2,3,4,5]).
pingpongA:"Dat Nguyen":15:26:55.291:pingpongA:handle_call:94: Server A get two list 
List1: [a,b,c,d,e]
List2: [1,2,3,4,5]

pingpongB:"Dat Nguyen":15:26:55.302:pingpongB:handle_call:94: 
List1: [a,b,c,d,e]
List2: [1,2,3,4,5]

B server is creating a Map from: [a,b,c,d,e], [1,2,3,4,5]pingpongA:"Dat Nguyen":15:26:55.316:pingpongA:handle_call:97: 
Server A get retured map from B 
Res: #{a => 1,b => 2,c => 3,d => 4,e => 5}

#{a => 1,b => 2,c => 3,d => 4,e => 5}
```